    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "This is also a major factor in the #BlueJays becoming a premiere destination for Japanese stars, which I expect to continue. What Taira or Okamoto face coming to MLB really isn't comparable to MLB free agents moving cities. Toronto has handled this very well. Word gets around.",
      "likes": 80,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-25T02:53:50.084Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n345rw5hwc2q",
      "jp_players": [
        "Okamoto"
      ],
      "jp": "これも#BlueJaysが日本人スターにとって屈指の移籍先になりつつある大きな要因で、今後も続くと見ている。Taira や岡本和真がMLBに来る際に直面することは、MLBのFA選手が球団を移るのとは比べものにならない。トロントはそこをうまく対応してきた。評判は広まる。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "This offseason, I've had two former #BlueJays tell me that, if everything were equal, Toronto is the only place they'd want to play. Money always wins, but that reputation is fully out there now. My working theory is that this is most valuable to veterans (with families), but...",
      "likes": 105,
      "reposts": 14,
      "replies": 10,
      "at": "2026-11-25T02:47:53.318Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n345hbvtms2p",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "This is also a major factor in the #BlueJays becoming a premiere destination for Japanese stars, which I expect to continue.\n\nWhat Taira or Okamoto face coming to MLB really isn't comparable to MLB free agents moving cities. Toronto has handled this very well. Word gets around.",
          "likes": 80,
          "author": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "All things equal I would also like to play for the blue jays",
          "likes": 9,
          "author": "8fullhourssleep.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "My guess is Gaus and Biebs. I’d still imagine one or both are still on their list",
          "likes": 5,
          "author": "huedub.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Are these recent former Blue Jays, or classic former Blue Jays?\n\nIt'd be interesting to see how that reputation has changed over the decades.",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "theterroirist.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "このオフ、元#BlueJaysの2人から「条件が同じなら、プレーしたいのはトロントだけ」と聞いた。結局は金がものを言うが、その評判はもう完全に定着している。私の見立てでは、特に家族のいるベテランにとって価値が大きいが…"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Guardians' rotation shopping continues. They've agreed to a three-year, $48 million deal with Foster Griffin, MLB.com's Mark Feinsand reports.",
      "likes": 42,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 5,
      "at": "2026-11-25T23:32:48.712Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36czeyde22o",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I’m curious if this much investment means Bibee is traded.",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "sleepingmonkey.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Me likey! Now sign a few bats",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "beerfartz.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I rather see Ben Lively in the rotation more than Foster Griffin",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "desarch.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Much better",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "deathtongue24.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ガーディアンズの先発補強が続く。MLB.comのマーク・ファインサンド記者によると、フォスター・グリフィンと3年4800万ドルで合意した。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "The Orioles and Luis Robert Jr. have agreed on a deal, source says, that brings the outfielder back to Baltimore. It’s one year for $12 million, source said. @JonHeyman first on terms. @FrancysRomero first said the Orioles are closing in on this.",
      "likes": 30,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-26T00:25:21.218Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36fxdhcfk2o",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "オリオールズとルイス・ロバート・ジュニアが合意に達したと関係者。外野手がボルチモアに戻る。1年1200万ドルとのこと。条件はジョン・ヘイマン記者が最初に報じ、オリオールズが大詰めと最初に伝えたのはフランシス・ロメロ記者。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Orioles outfielders in 2026 combined to produce a .225 average and .674 on-base-plus-slugging percentage, both of which were third worst in baseball. They need a lift. Luis Robert Jr. may not be the final one",
      "likes": 25,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-26T01:01:46.082Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36hyh3wqk2h",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "2026年のオリオールズ外野陣は合計で打率.225、OPS.674。ともにMLBでワースト3位だった。底上げが必要だ。ルイス・ロバート・ジュニアが最後の補強とは限らない"
    },
    {
